      "name": "Bootstrap Platform",
      "description": "One-time platform setup: Vaultwarden, Ntfy, the reverse proxy, Authentik, Uptime Kuma, Prometheus + Grafana and PBS, in that order. Re-runnable, but it is a bootstrap — run it once, then use the per-app jobs.",
